/strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just decorate; master the financial and personnel management aspects of the business. The figures in your profit margin are the true indicator of your success.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personnel Management:</strong> Hire, train, and manage the salaries of experienced dealers and friendly service staff to ensure smooth operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Service and Comps:</strong> Earn customer loyalty by offering high-class service, cocktails, food, and complimentary treats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Financial Pressure:</strong> Keep cash flow under control by carefully tracking debt, credit, and weekly operating expenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗑️ <strong>BUILD A JUNK EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city's recycling centers are an unexpected gold mine for a boss starting from the ground up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Resource Mechanic:</strong> Utilize the city's secret resources by collecting &quot;junk&quot; (scrap, waste, etc.). Process it or sell it directly to generate crucial extra income to fund your glamorous renovations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 <strong>GAMING AND ENTERTAINMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, it's all about the thrill! Add various games of chance to your casino floor.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Games:</strong> Engage your customers with an array of flashy Slot machines and classic Blackjack tables featuring simple, addictive rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purely Entertainment:</strong> <i>Disclaimer: The game does not include real money rewards or real betting elements; it is purely focused on the simulation and management experience.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on 